<title>USA: American Eco to sell two units.</title>
<headline>American Eco to sell two units.</headline>
<dateline>HOUSTON 1997-08-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>American Eco Corp said Friday it has agreed  to sell Eco Environmental Inc, a remediation subsidiary, and Environmental  Evolutions Inc., an emergency response subsidiary, to UKstar (Canada)  Inc for undisclosed terms.</p>
<p>It said UKstar is a private Ontario company headed by Peter Davies,  the former British Counsel General to Canada.</p>
<p>American Eco said the sale is part of its strategic plan to concentrate  on its growing industrial services and specialty fabrication businesses  units.</p>
<p>((-- New York Newsdesk 212 859-1610))</p>
</text>
